### Add Complaint Sidebar Links via REST API
### Use this file with REST Client extension in VS Code
### Or copy curl commands to terminal

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. File Complaint (Selection Page) - All Roles
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/additional/sidebar-links
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "parentLink": "Complaints",
  "childLink": "/file-complaint",
  "label": "File Complaint",
  "isParentOnly": false,
  "icon": "FileText",
  "status": "active",
  "role": ["Admin", "Developer", "PMS", "TMS", "CA", "Rider"],
  "order": 1
}

### 2. User Complaint - All Roles
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/additional/sidebar-links
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "parentLink": "Complaints",
  "childLink": "/complaint/user/create",
  "label": "User Complaint",
  "isParentOnly": false,
  "icon": "User",
  "status": "active",
  "role": ["Admin", "Developer", "PMS", "TMS", "CA", "Rider"],
  "order": 2
}

### 3. Admin Complaint - Admin & Developer Only
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/additional/sidebar-links
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "parentLink": "Complaints",
  "childLink": "/complaint/admin/create",
  "label": "Admin Complaint",
  "isParentOnly": false,
  "icon": "UserCog",
  "status": "active",
  "role": ["Admin", "Developer"],
  "order": 3
}

### 4. All Complaints - All Roles
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/additional/sidebar-links
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "parentLink": "Complaints",
  "childLink": "/user-complaint",
  "label": "All Complaints",
  "isParentOnly": false,
  "icon": "List",
  "status": "active",
  "role": ["Admin", "Developer", "PMS", "TMS", "CA", "Rider"],
  "order": 4
}

### 5. Your Complaints - All Roles
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/additional/sidebar-links
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "parentLink": "Complaints",
  "childLink": "/your-complaints",
  "label": "Your Complaints",
  "isParentOnly": false,
  "icon": "MessageSquare",
  "status": "active",
  "role": ["Admin", "Developer", "PMS", "TMS", "CA", "Rider"],
  "order": 5
}

### Verify: Get all Complaints sidebar links
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/additional/sidebar-links?status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### CURL COMMANDS (Alternative)
### ============================================

# Replace YOUR_TOKEN and localhost:5000 with your values

# 1. File Complaint
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/additional/sidebar-links \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -d '{
    "parentLink": "Complaints",
    "childLink": "/file-complaint",
    "label": "File Complaint",
    "isParentOnly": false,
    "icon": "FileText",
    "status": "active",
    "role": ["Admin", "Developer", "PMS", "TMS", "CA", "Rider"],
    "order": 1
  }'

# 2. User Complaint
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/additional/sidebar-links \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -d '{
    "parentLink": "Complaints",
    "childLink": "/complaint/user/create",
    "label": "User Complaint",
    "isParentOnly": false,
    "icon": "User",
    "status": "active",
    "role": ["Admin", "Developer", "PMS", "TMS", "CA", "Rider"],
    "order": 2
  }'

# 3. Admin Complaint (Admin & Developer only)
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/additional/sidebar-links \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -d '{
    "parentLink": "Complaints",
    "childLink": "/complaint/admin/create",
    "label": "Admin Complaint",
    "isParentOnly": false,
    "icon": "UserCog",
    "status": "active",
    "role": ["Admin", "Developer"],
    "order": 3
  }'

# 4. All Complaints
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/additional/sidebar-links \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -d '{
    "parentLink": "Complaints",
    "childLink": "/user-complaint",
    "label": "All Complaints",
    "isParentOnly": false,
    "icon": "List",
    "status": "active",
    "role": ["Admin", "Developer", "PMS", "TMS", "CA", "Rider"],
    "order": 4
  }'

# 5. Your Complaints
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/additional/sidebar-links \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -d '{
    "parentLink": "Complaints",
    "childLink": "/your-complaints",
    "label": "Your Complaints",
    "isParentOnly": false,
    "icon": "MessageSquare",
    "status": "active",
    "role": ["Admin", "Developer", "PMS", "TMS", "CA", "Rider"],
    "order": 5
  }'
